R1  8.5.11 OOM fires in vulnerable rfc1867 pre-request parser : CONFIRMED
R2  8.5.11 leaked previous request's $_POST on next request  : not leaked (dev server masks it; fix verified in R3)
R3  8.5.12 fix mechanisms present & absent from 8.5.11       : CONFIRMED
R4  CGI exit-code mapping (exit-121 unreachable in NTS)      : measured (both 255, see note)
R5  HashTable OOM kills NEXT request on 8.5.11; all controls (no-cookie / text-OOM / 8.5.12 / default-cap) survive: CONFIRMED
